        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>基于深度注册的嵌入式图像合成 — 学术论文海报</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .poster {\n    width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdf6ee;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Header banner ---------- */\n  .header {\n    height: 120px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f07c1a 0%, #f18a22 55%, #f7c98a 80%, #fdf6ee 100%);\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .header .deco-left {\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 100px;\n    opacity: .5;\n  }\n  .header-inner {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 14px 18px 0 14px;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .iscas-logo {\n    font-family: Arial Black, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(120,50,0,.4);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .conf-title {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .conf-title .yr {\n    font-family: Arial Black, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #fff;\n    vertical-align: -2px;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    padding-left: 10px;\n  }\n  .star {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 20px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Title block ---------- */\n  .titleblock {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 55px 40px 18px 40px;\n  }\n  .titleblock h1 {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n    letter-spacing: -0.3px;\n  }\n  .titleblock h2 {\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .titleblock .authors {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .titleblock .venue {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .titleblock .contact {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Two column body ---------- */\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 26px;\n    padding: 14px 28px 30px 28px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .col {\n    flex: 1 1 0;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n  h3.section {\n    color: #e8172a;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 14px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  h3.section:first-child { margin-top: 0; }\n  p.body {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  p.body.noindent { text-indent: 0; }\n  .subhead {\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 12px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  ul.plain, ol.plain {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 0;\n    list-style: none;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  ul.plain li { margin-bottom: 2px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Placeholders ---------- */\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #ececec;\n    border: 1px solid #bbb;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  figure { margin: 0; }\n  figcaption {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* image grid for (a)-(f) composites */\n  .grid2 {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 6px 8px;\n  }\n  .grid2 .placeholder { height: 76px; }\n\n  .grid6 {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);\n    gap: 3px;\n  }\n  .grid6 .placeholder { height: 52px; font-size: 7px; }\n  .grid6-caption {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);\n    gap: 3px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 3px;\n  }\n\n  .figrow {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 4px;\n  }\n  .figrow figure { flex: 1; }\n\n  /* ---------- Tables ---------- */\n  table.data {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 100%;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    margin: 4px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  table.data th, table.data td {\n    border-top: 1px solid #333;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 1px 2px;\n    text-align: center;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  table.data tbody td {\n    border-top: none;\n    border-bottom: none;\n  }\n  table.data tbody tr:last-child td {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;\n  }\n  table.data tr.avg td {\n    border-top: 1px solid #333;\n  }\n  table.data thead tr.grouphead th {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #555;\n  }\n\n  table.small {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    margin: 4px auto 6px auto;\n    width: 62%;\n  }\n  table.small th, table.small td {\n    padding: 1px 4px;\n    text-align: center;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  table.small thead th { border-top: 1px solid #333; border-bottom: 1px solid #333; }\n  table.small tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 1px solid #333; }\n  table.small tr.avg td { border-top: 1px solid #333; }\n\n  /* ---------- Footer banner ---------- */\n  .footer {\n    height: 110px;\n    background: linear-gradient(0deg, #f07c1a 0%, #f5972f 45%, #fbc98d 75%, #fdf6ee 100%);\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .footer .glow {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 90px;\n    bottom: 18px;\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 60px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, #fff 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%);\n  }\n  .chart-note { font-size: 8px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"poster\">\n\n  <!-- ================= HEADER ================= -->\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"header-inner\">\n      <div class=\"iscas-logo\">ISCAS</div>\n      <div class=\"conf-title\">\n        中国科学院软件研究所学术年会’<span class=\"yr\">2023</span><br>\n        暨计算机科学国家重点实验室开放周\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"star\">✳</div>\n      <div class=\"badge\">学术论文</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= TITLE ================= -->\n  <div class=\"titleblock\">\n    <h1>Image Composition with Depth Registration</h1>\n    <h2>基于深度注册的嵌入式图像合成</h2>\n    <p class=\"authors\">李赞、王文成、侯飞</p>\n    <p class=\"venue\">International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence(IJCAI-2023)</p>\n    <p class=\"contact\">联系人：李赞，18810762067，lizhan@ios.ac.cn</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= TWO COLUMNS ================= -->\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n\n    <!-- ---------- LEFT COLUMN ---------- -->\n    <div class=\"col\">\n\n      <h3 class=\"section\">背景</h3>\n      <p class=\"body\">图像合成是指将不同图像中的内容融合成一张看似真实的图像。已有的图像合成方法主要探讨色彩、阴影和亮度的和谐生成，对于图像内容之间的遮挡关系研究不多，往往需要费时的手动处理而效率不高。</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"section\">方法</h3>\n      <p class=\"body\">本文提出新的方法，从源图像中选择要融入目标图像中的内容（称为源内容）后，通过深度注册，将源内容融入目标图像所表达的三维空间中，由此，用户进行源内容在目标图像中不同位置的摆放时，融合处理可基于图像内容的深度方便判断它们之间的遮挡关系，以得到遮挡关系合理处理的合成图像。其处理步骤如下：</p>\n      <ul class=\"plain\">\n        <li>(a)基于深度学习方法进行源图像和目标图像的深度估计；</li>\n        <li>(b)基于深度注册初始化，将源内容融入目标图像所表达的三维空间；</li>\n        <li>(c)迭代进行图像分割和深度的调整，以优化深度注册，直至获得满意的合成结果。</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <figure style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%;height:95px;\">[Diagram: 方法流程图 — Source image / (a) Source image patch / (b) difference template / (c) size template / (d) target source image patch / (e) refinement / depth / segmentation / satisfied? / Output]</div>\n      </figure>\n\n      <p class=\"subhead\">深度注册：</p>\n      <ul class=\"plain\">\n        <li>(a)将源内容放至目标图像中，并调整某大小使得其与目标图像中的一个内容具有相似深度；</li>\n        <li>(b)将目标图像中该内容的锚点像素的深度值赋予源内容的锚点像素（一般来说选择图像内容所有像素中y值最小的点作为锚点）；</li>\n        <li>(c)根据相机成像原理，建立源内容深度和大小之间的关系；</li>\n        <li>(d)用户根据编辑意向设定源内容的位置、大小后，根据上述关系计算源内容各像素的深度，完成深度注册。</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <div class=\"figrow\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"height:70px;\">[Photo: 草原牛群 输入]</div>\n          <figcaption>(a)输入</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"height:70px;\">[Photo: 深度注册结果]</div>\n          <figcaption>(b)深度注册</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"height:70px;\">[Diagram: 锚点放大示意]</div>\n          <figcaption>(c)锚点</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"subhead\">分割 / 深度的优化调整：</p>\n      <ul class=\"plain\">\n        <li>(a)分割优化：根据合成图像需求，进行更细致合理的分割，如分割开椅子座上的鸭子等。</li>\n        <li>(b)深度优化：根据编辑操作建立约束条件，更新源内容的深度值，以更适合图像合成处理。</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h3 class=\"section\">实验结果</h3>\n      <p class=\"body\">本方法中逐步优化的深度注册，使源内容更合理融入目标图像对应的三维空间，方便图像合成的遮挡关系处理。如下图所示，在用户频繁改变源图像内容的位置时，只有第一次嵌入需要进行分割优化处理，故交互次数稍高。随后，再次改变源图像内容的位置，则无需更多的调整；反观常用的Photoshop方法，其每次合成处理都需要较多的用户交互。</p>\n\n      <figure style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%;height:150px;\">[Chart: 折线图 — 纵轴 interventions (0–80)，横轴 composition orders (1–4)；PhotoShop 曲线 54, 67, 59, 62；Our method 曲线 7, 3, 2, 2]</div>\n      </figure>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ---------- RIGHT COLUMN ---------- -->\n    <div class=\"col\">\n\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 目标图像 — 骑行者与行人]</div>\n          <figcaption>(a)目标图像</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 源图像 — 骑行者]</div>\n          <figcaption>(b)源图像</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 第一次合成结果]</div>\n          <figcaption>(c)第一次合成</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 第二次合成结果]</div>\n          <figcaption>(d)第二次合成</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 第三次合成结果]</div>\n          <figcaption>(e)第三次合成</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 第四次合成结果]</div>\n          <figcaption>(f)第四次合成</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"body\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">本方法所得到合成结果，与基于深度学习的CompGAN方法、传统Tan的方法相比，能合理处理遮挡关系；与PhotoShop方法相比，合成结果相当，但我们所需时间和交互次数大幅减少。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"grid6\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 鹰]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 木屋墙]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: compGAN]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Tan]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: PS]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Ours]</div>\n\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 气球]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 房间]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: compGAN]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Tan]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: PS]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Ours]</div>\n\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 盆栽]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 餐桌]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: compGAN]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Tan]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: PS]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Ours]</div>\n\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 衣物]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 沙发]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: compGAN]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Tan]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: PS]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Ours]</div>\n\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 棒球]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 纸箱]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: compGAN]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Tan]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: PS]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Ours]</div>\n\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 玩具熊]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 室内]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: compGAN]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Tan]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: PS]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: Ours]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid6-caption\">\n        <div>(a)源图像</div>\n        <div>(b)目标图像</div>\n        <div>(c)compGAN</div>\n        <div>(d)Tan的方法</div>\n        <div>(e)PS</div>\n        <div>(f)我们的方法</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"body\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">对于上图的八个例子，我们用准确率和IF1分数来度量源内容在合成图像中具有正确遮挡标签的像素占比，结果如下表所示：</p>\n\n      <table class=\"data\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr class=\"grouphead\">\n            <th></th>\n            <th colspan=\"5\">Accuracy</th>\n            <th colspan=\"5\">F1 score</th>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th></th>\n            <th>CompGAN</th><th>Tan's</th><th>PS</th><th>Ours</th><th>Our*</th>\n            <th>CompGAN</th><th>Tan's</th><th>PS</th><th>Ours</th><th>Our*</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Row1</td><td>0.2100</td><td>0.7001</td><td>1.0000</td><td>1.0000</td><td>-</td><td>0.3472</td><td>0.8236</td><td>1.0000</td><td><b>0.9912</b></td><td>-</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row2</td><td>0.0000</td><td>0.7951</td><td>1.0000</td><td><b>0.9896</b></td><td>-</td><td>0.0000</td><td>0.8858</td><td>1.0000</td><td><b>0.9948</b></td><td>-</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row3</td><td>0.1674</td><td>0.8163</td><td>1.0000</td><td><b>0.9799</b></td><td>-</td><td>0.2694</td><td>0.8989</td><td>1.0000</td><td><b>0.9875</b></td><td>-</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row4</td><td>0.4322</td><td>0.6304</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.7846</td><td>0.9995</td><td>0.5186</td><td>0.7733</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.8326</td><td>0.9996</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row5</td><td>0.4503</td><td>0.7913</td><td>1.0000</td><td><b>0.9687</b></td><td>-</td><td>0.5910</td><td>0.8835</td><td>1.0000</td><td><b>0.9798</b></td><td>-</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row6</td><td>0.5222</td><td>0.5786</td><td>1.0000</td><td><b>0.9731</b></td><td>-</td><td>0.6557</td><td>0.7331</td><td>1.0000</td><td><b>0.9762</b></td><td>-</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row7</td><td>0.0000</td><td>0.9178</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9218</td><td><b>0.9887</b></td><td>0.0000</td><td>0.9572</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9586</td><td><b>0.9938</b></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row8</td><td>0.1998</td><td>0.8357</td><td>1.0000</td><td><b>0.9889</b></td><td>-</td><td>0.3363</td><td>0.9105</td><td>1.0000</td><td><b>0.9884</b></td><td>-</td></tr>\n          <tr class=\"avg\"><td>Average</td><td>0.2477</td><td>0.7582</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9477</td><td>0.9941</td><td>0.3398</td><td>0.8582</td><td>1.0000</td><td>0.9637</td><td>0.9967</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <p class=\"body\">可以看到我们的方法在各项指标中都是最好的。上表中，Ours*表示使用优化调整的结果，可知我们只有极少次需要用到优化调整，大多数情况下可以直接得到和PhotoShop相媲美的结果。如下表所示，本方法平均比Photoshop方法快4倍多，所需交互次数也少很多。</p>\n\n      <table class=\"small\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th></th>\n            <th colspan=\"2\">Photoshop</th>\n            <th colspan=\"2\">Ours</th>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th></th>\n            <th>Time</th><th>Interventions</th><th>Time</th><th>Interventions</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Row 1</td><td>142.0s</td><td>71</td><td>33.0s</td><td>4</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row 2</td><td>158.0s</td><td>84</td><td>34.0s</td><td>5</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row 3</td><td>139.0s</td><td>87</td><td>32.0s</td><td>4</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row 4</td><td>160.0s</td><td>93</td><td>44.0s</td><td>5</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row 5</td><td>144.0s</td><td>77</td><td>45.0s</td><td>5</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row 6</td><td>137.0s</td><td>75</td><td>33.0s</td><td>4</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row 7</td><td>133.0s</td><td>82</td><td>35.0s</td><td>4</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Row 8</td><td>152.0s</td><td>73</td><td>34.0s</td><td>4</td></tr>\n          <tr class=\"avg\"><td>Average</td><td>145.6s</td><td>80.3</td><td>36.3s</td><td>4.4</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <h3 class=\"section\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">结论</h3>\n      <p class=\"body\">本文提出的深度注册方法，促进了嵌入式图像合成的方便高效实现，降低了图像内容创作门槛，将提高电影、动画和艺术创作等领域的工作成效。</p>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= FOOTER ================= -->\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"glow\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
      "finish_reason": "stop"
    }
  ],
